        "original_id": "1f278f8e-73cd-525b-a7f7-b8c2ef620a57",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Feodor Chin, David Huynh, Stephane Gauger, Francesca Eastwood, Clifton Collins Jr., Leah McKendrick, Peter Vack, Marlon Young, David Sullivan, Michael Welch, Mike Manning\n- Companies: Blizzard Entertainment, Activision Blizzard\n- Products: Overwatch, M.F.A., Chinatown Squad, Baby\n- Places: Irvine, California, San Francisco Chinatown\n- Roles: Zenyatta, Fong, Pistol Pete\n\nFacts:\n- Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. is an American video game developer and publisher based in Irvine, California, and it is a subsidiary of Activision Blizzard.\n- Overwatch is a game by Blizzard Entertainment.\n- Feodor Chin voices Zenyatta in Overwatch.\n- Chinatown Squad is a pilot about 1890s San Francisco Chinatown.\n- Stephane Gauger directed and produced Chinatown Squad.\n- Feodor Chin wrote Chinatown Squad, starred in it, and played the antagonist Pistol Pete.\n- David Huynh appeared in Chinatown Squad as the protagonist Fong.\n- Baby is a co-star connection between David Huynh and Feodor Chin.\n- M.F.A. stars Francesca Eastwood, Clifton Collins Jr., Leah McKendrick, Peter Vack, David Huynh, Marlon Young, David Sullivan, Michael Welch, and Mike Manning.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
